[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003001.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on a lift.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752827\">Op. 4450B06 LEFT REAR WHEEL R R</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752828\">Op. 4450B08 RIGHT REAR WHEEL R R</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753308\">Op. 7055B48 REAR WHEEL ARCH LINER (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R.</a></p><p>[Both]</p><p><a href=\"#/169002235\">Op. 7055A26 MOULDING ON REAR WHEEL ARCH (ONE) LH OR RH R R</a></p><p>[Both]</p>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p>1. Working in the wheel arch compartments, unscrew the side bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003002.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p>1. Undo the lower fixing bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003003.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p>1. Undo the upper retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the bumper.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003004.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Position the bumper in its seat.</p><p>2. Tighten the upper fixing bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003005.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p>1. Tighten the lower fixing bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003006.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p>1. Working from the wheel arch compartments, tighten the side bolts.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/169003007.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,1,2097152,"<p><a href=\"#/169002235\">Op. 7055A26 MOULDING ON REAR WHEEL ARCH (ONE) LH OR RH R R</a></p><p>[Both]</p><p><a href=\"#/2753308\">Op. 7055B48 REAR WHEEL ARCH LINER (ONE), LEFT OR RIGHT - R.R.</a></p><p>[Both]</p><p><a href=\"#/2752828\">Op. 4450B08 RIGHT REAR WHEEL R R</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752827\">Op. 4450B06 LEFT REAR WHEEL R R</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]